{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Going and weeping</b> — the meaning: he would weep, out of fear lest the seed be lost." "And the meaning of משך — the vessel in which the seed is." "And the vav of אלומותיו — it returns to the seed, and this is a parable for the reward of those who keep the Torah and endure the exile."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 126, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:20.114433629Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}